From Beam WRT (Timofey Maykov, GPL-2.0, commit e45121f2), author kept:
- 0908 spi-qpic-snand: ECC strength by JEDEC ID like the stock kernel.
  Newer boards carry an ESMT F50D1G41LB (64 B OOB, 4 bit ECC); with the
  8 bit from the DTS UBI cannot attach and nothing boots. GigaDevice
  parts with 128 B OOB (c8:c1/41/81) keep 8 bit — the running board is
  unchanged.
